<title>FRANCE: Labinal 1996 turnover up 12.6 pct.</title>
<headline>Labinal 1996 turnover up 12.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover					11,662    vs   10,362</p>
<p>    Parent company				 1,479    vs    1,404</p>
<p>NOTE - Labinal said in newspaper notice that the figures were provisional. It said turnover rose 12.6 percent. At comparable structure, turnover rose nine percent and at comparable structure and exchange rates, turnover rose 5.1 percent.</p>
</text>
